out.push("\n\n### 16.1 完整 Liquid 实现示例\n\n```liquid\n{%- liquid\n  assign form_id = 'NewsletterForm-' | append: section.id\n  assign email_id = 'NewsletterEmail-' | append: section.id\n  assign error_id = 'NewsletterError-' | append: section.id\n-%}\n\n{% form 'customer', id: form_id %}\n\n  <input\n    type=\"hidden\"\n    name=\"contact[tags]\"\n    value=\"newsletter\"\n  >\n\n  <label for=\"{{ email_id }}\">\n    Email address\n  </label>\n\n  <input\n    id=\"{{ email_id }}\"\n    type=\"email\"\n    name=\"contact[email]\"\n    value=\"{{ form.email | escape }}\"\n    autocomplete=\"email\"\n    autocorrect=\"off\"\n    autocapitalize=\"off\"\n    required\n\n    {% if form.errors %}\n      aria-invalid=\"true\"\n      aria-describedby=\"{{ error_id }}\"\n    {% endif %}\n  >\n\n  <button type=\"submit\">\n    Subscribe\n  </button>\n\n  {% if form.errors %}\n    <div\n      id=\"{{ error_id }}\"\n      class=\"form-error\"\n      tabindex=\"-1\"\n    >\n      {{ form.errors | default_errors }}\n    </div>\n  {% endif %}\n\n  {% if form.posted_successfully? %}\n    <p\n      id=\"NewsletterSuccess-{{ section.id }}\"\n      class=\"form-success\"\n      tabindex=\"-1\"\n    >\n      Thank you for subscribing.\n    </p>\n  {% endif %}\n\n{% endform %}\n```\n\n这是一个简化的教学实现，不是 Dawn 源码的直接复制。实际多语言项目应当使用 Theme 的 locale 翻译文件输出表单文案。\n\n### 16.2 为什么要结合 section.id 生成 ID？\n\n因为 Shopify Online Store 2.0 的 Section 可以在页面中被多次添加。\n\n假设首页中存在三个 Newsletter Section，如果全部使用：\n\n```html\n<input id=\"NewsletterEmail\">\n```\n\n就会产生重复 ID，可能导致 label 与 input 的关联错误。\n\n");
